[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h>        CONVERT-FIELDS.
[?2004l[?2004h>            MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-LOAN-STR) TO WS-LOAN-AMT
[?2004l[?2004h>            MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-PROP-STR) TO WS-PROP-VAL
[?2004l[?2004h>            MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-DOWN-STR) TO WS-DOWN-PAY
[?2004l[?2004h>            MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TERM-STR) TO WS-TERM-YEARS
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h>            IF WS-RATE-STR = SPACES
[?2004l[?2004h>                MOVE 0 TO WS-RATE
