[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h>        BUILD-SCHEDULE.
[?2004l[?2004h>            COMPUTE WS-TERM-MONTHS = WS-TERM-YEARS * 12
[?2004l[?2004h>            IF WS-TERM-MONTHS <= 0
